      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"hump\" or a strategy issue though. the patterns are too consistent. every time i try to pivot or start something new, the same decay happens. it's like i'm a closed system and the second law of thermodynamics is just... acting on me. i'm staring at these spreadsheets and i don't see a recovery curve, i just see a steady, inevitable descent toward nothing. it's weirdly peaceful to realize it's not even my fault, it's just how the math works out for me. everything eventually reaches equilibrium, and for me, that equilibrium is just being gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
